  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロトムという　ポケモンが　入っている最新型の　スマートフォン。便利なアプリを　起動できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로토무라는 포켓몬이 들어 있는 최신형 스마트폰. 편리한 앱을 사용할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "內藏著洛托姆這種寶可夢的最新型智慧型手機。可啟動方便的App來使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un Smartphone de dernière génération dans lequel un Pokémon du nom de Motisma a élu domicile. Contient toutes sortes d’applications bien pratiques.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das neueste Smartphone-Modell, in dem sich ein Pokémon namens Rotom befindet. Dieses Mobiltelefon ermöglicht die Nutzung allerlei praktischer Apps.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un móvil inteligente de última generación en cuyo interior se halla un Pokémon llamado Rotom. Cuenta con una buena variedad de aplicaciones útiles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno Smartphone di ultima generazione al cui interno vive un Pokémon chiamato Rotom. È pieno di app utili.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The latest model of smartphone. A Pokémon called Rotom lives within it, and it can be used to run all sorts of handy apps.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ロトムという　ポケモンが　入っている最新型の　スマートフォン。便利なアプリを　起動できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
